OL,3,ARussian strikes hit key power plant in
OL,4,AKyiv, Zelensky says
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes two days after US President
OL,7,FDonald Trump said an energy ceasefire
OL,8,Fhad been agreed by Russia and Ukraine,
OL,9,Falthough Kyiv reported multiple Russian
OL,10,Fstrikes following the announcement.
